{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/16a766d4edc058f6fb2089fc4cb2cf79.avif?t=1772537283\" width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/f904662d84bb574f156df9c13b1542d9.avif?t=1772537283\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn ocean garbage into homes, workshops and colorful little gardens.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect floating plastic and driftwood, salvage scraps of the old world, and recycle them into homes that stay afloat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desalinate water, gut fish and board up a shelter to keep everyone safe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your town with plants, refurbished furniture and statues that keep your drifters happy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.poster.avif?t=1772537283\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.webm?t=1772537283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.mp4?t=1772537283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/8a21d353442f727541b7ebc96dc278e9.avif?t=1772537283\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail to explore the flooded world, from soaked ruins to forgotten islands, and discover what still floats beyond the horizon.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore flooded remnants of the old world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue stranded survivors and friendly animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-discover old technology to improve your town. But be careful your drifters don\u2019t get sick. The old world is polluted!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.poster.avif?t=1772537283\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.webm?t=1772537283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.mp4?t=1772537283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/5dd537caa53686aa9973a1c13fb7ad08.avif?t=1772537283\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your drifters each have their own stories to tell. Recruit specialists who unlock new buildings, quests, and discoveries for your floating community.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find unique drifters like the Birdkeeper, Chemist, and Electrician</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new technologies and story quests through their expertise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete personal storylines to unlock new mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.poster.avif?t=1772537283\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.webm?t=1772537283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.mp4?t=1772537283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/23732757365750783c6be85d74ec0118.avif?t=1772537283\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop cleaner, smarter systems that turn waste into progress and keep your floating town thriving in this feel-good apocalypse.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new tech to transition from burning firewood to green eel-ectricity generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build connected production pipelines that turn your floating town into a self-sustaining ecosystem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean food and develop cures for pollution-born diseases and keep your drifters healthy and productive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.poster.avif?t=1772537283\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.webm?t=1772537283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.mp4?t=1772537283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"a17928e51bdcbc6bb15e5b41c344b75c325db5da.jpg","localized_name":"The Questionable Fishionary","name":"The Questionable Fishionary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821250/a17928e51bdcbc6bb15e5b41c344b75c325db5da.jpg"},{"icon":"66643c6dafe01e405488564868fe8db1bcac48b5.jpg","localized_name":"The Inspection Connection","name":"The Inspection Connection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821250/66643c6dafe01e405488564868fe8db1bcac48b5.jpg"},{"icon":"d10c8cae81a478b344b77fc6c6d4f4d2271e5be2.jpg","localized_name":"Gull-Fu Sensei","name":"Gull-Fu Sensei","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821250/d10c8cae81a478b344b77fc6c6d4f4d2271e5be2.jpg"},{"icon":"b4ea089b49ac63c6249ae5dd42a72ad79b529c9d.jpg","localized_name":"Photosympathist","name":"Photosympathist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821250/b4ea089b49ac63c6249ae5dd42a72ad79b529c9d.jpg"},{"icon":"a8988d5a1a9534810ab663b4f35134490e4cca22.jpg","localized_name":"Five-Starfish Chef","name":"Five-Starfish Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821250/a8988d5a1a9534810ab663b4f35134490e4cca22.jpg"},{"icon":"fbd287308bb7af8ae68cfcc6105f0752202e575e.jpg","localized_name":"Ill Dottore","name":"Ill Dottore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821250/fbd287308bb7af8ae68cfcc6105f0752202e575e.jpg"},{"icon":"7a427ebd193dfc5da4bdbfc7d1ee35475d1f39dd.jpg","localized_name":"Power Tripping","name":"Power Tripping","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/821250/7a427ebd193dfc5da4bdbfc7d1ee35475d1f39dd.jpg"},{"icon":"b2b3d996702b06a57ebf99e057ddfd030318ffd2.jpg","localized_name":"Goop Scoop","name":"Goop Scoop